From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] shcore: internal ordinal exports (3570)

shcore: implement the internal ordinal exports shlwapi and shell32 share

StrRetToStrW/BufW/BSTR, SHAnsiToUnicodeCP/SHUnicodeToAnsiCP, PathIsNetworkPathA/W, PathBuildRootA/W,
DriveType, SHCreateDirectory/ExA/ExW (recursive, ERROR_ALREADY_EXISTS / ERROR_FILE_EXISTS / ERROR_BAD_PATHNAME),
shared memory blocks (SHAllocShared, SHMapHandle, SHLockShared[Ex], SHUnlockShared, SHFreeShared across
processes), SHCreateWorkerWindowW, GUIDFromStringW, SHRegGetCLSIDKey, SHGetValueGoodBootA/W,
SHLoadRegUIStringW, IUnknown_GetClassID, IUnknown_ProfferService, SHSetWindowSubclass family.
---
